    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39129" root="نأش" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَؤُوشٌ</span></b>  <i>Strong; overcoming;</i> or <i>prevailing;</i>
(K;) <i>possessing might</i> or <i>strength, courage, valour,</i>
or <i>prowess.</i> (TA.) You say also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَدَرٌ نَؤُوشٌ</span> <i>An
overcoming decree;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَوَّاشٌ</span>. (TA.) See
also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نوش</span>.

